msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「......When it rains, it pours...... No, third＿time's the charm!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Llueve sobre mojado......＿¡No, la tercera es la vencida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Crap. What am I so afraid of......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Rayos. ¿Por qué tengo＿tanto miedo......?）」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¿Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, hey!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, hola!」"

msgid "Minori「What are you doing here?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué haces aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Waiting for you, Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te estoy esperando, Kushieda.」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh, I see. Been waiting long?」"
msgstr "Minori「......Ah, ya veo. ¿Llevas＿mucho esperando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, kinda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, un poco.」"

msgid "Minori「I see...... So, what is it?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo...... Entonces, ¿qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I need to talk to you. I want to pick up＿where we left off a couple nights ago.＿Can I borrow you for a while?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Necesito hablar contigo. Quiero＿retomar lo de hace un par de noches.＿¿Tienes un momento?」"

msgid "Minori「......Do I have to hear you out?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Tengo que escucharte?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, you're saying let's＿continue, but you're starting a whole＿new topic, aren't you?」"
msgstr "Minori「Takasu-kun, dices que quieres＿retomar el tema, pero vas a empezar＿otro distinto, ¿no?」"

msgid "Minori「That's against the rules.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso va contra las reglas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「I understand that much...... Takasu-kun,＿your expression is totally different＿from usual.」"
msgstr "Minori「Eso sí lo entiendo...... Takasu-kun,＿tu expresión es muy distinta＿a la de siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're...... right, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo...... que tienes razón.」"

msgid "Minori「Yup, you look crazy fired up. But also＿somewhat sad. You follow me?」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, pareces muy decidido. Pero también＿algo triste. ¿Me entiendes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't follow what you're trying to＿say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No entiendo qué intentas decir.」"

msgid "Minori「Alright. Then, until you get it...... Nah, I＿thought of asking you to consider it,＿but I won't.」"
msgstr "Minori「Bien. Entonces, hasta que＿entiendas...... No, iba a pedirte＿que lo pensaras, pero no lo haré.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Just for your information, I'm sticking＿to my convictions. And I'm sure they＿won't ever change.」"
msgstr "Minori「Para que lo sepas, me mantengo＿firme en mis convicciones. Y＿sé que nunca cambiarán.」"

msgid "Minori「I know I'm being arrogant and it's＿unfair. So――」"
msgstr "Minori「Sé que soy arrogante y que＿es injusto. Así que――」"

msgid "\"I can't hear you out, Takasu-kun.\""
msgstr "\"No puedo escucharte, Takasu-kun.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's already so late......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ya es muy tarde......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Crap...... Yasuko's already about to＿leave......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Rayos...... Yasuko ya＿está por salir......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Hm?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wh...... What's all the commotion......?＿Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qu...... Qué es todo este＿alboroto......? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga had already been taken to the＿hospital in an ambulance.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya se habían llevado a Taiga＿al hospital en ambulancia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I came this far on my own two feet......＿Sure, I needed some encouragement,＿but no one told me to go this time. I）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Llegué hasta aquí por mi cuenta......＿Sí, necesité algo de ánimo, pero nadie＿me mandó esta vez. Yo）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（came of my own volition. Can't lose my＿nerve here!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（vine por voluntad propia. ¡No＿puedo acobardarme ahora!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But the third time...... Well, technically＿it's the second time, but I'm still not＿used to it...... Wait, no one could get）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pero la tercera vez...... Bueno, en＿realidad es la segunda, pero aún no me＿acostumbro...... ¡No, nadie podría）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（used to this! Am I retarded!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（acostumbrarse a esto! ¡¿Soy idiota?!）」"

msgid "Minori「Even if I had you consider it, I'm not＿sure I'd be satisfied. Besides, if you＿think about it, I'm sure there's」"
msgstr "Minori「Aunque lo pensaras, no sé si quedaría＿satisfecha. Además, si lo piensas＿bien, seguro hay」"

msgid "Minori「someone you need to talk to more than＿me.」"
msgstr "Minori「alguien con quien necesitas＿hablar más que conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wading through the crowd of＿onlookers, I caught the evacuated＿landlady and learned that the cause of」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me abrí paso entre los curiosos＿y encontré a la casera, ya evacuada.＿Me dijo que la causa del」"

msgid "Ryuuji「the commotion was a small fire that＿had started on the second floor. In＿other words, in Taiga's house.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「alboroto era un pequeño incendio＿en el segundo piso. Es decir,＿en casa de Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then, I learned from the firefighters＿that Taiga was confirmed to be＿unharmed. Yet she wasn't at the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Luego, los bomberos me＿confirmaron que Taiga estaba ilesa. Pero＿ella no estaba en el」"

msgid "Ryuuji「scene――」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「lugar――」"
